values ('hsk2-l12', 'hsk2', 'HSK2', 12, '你穿得太少了', 'Nǐ chuān de tài shǎo le', 'You wear too little', '{"level": "hsk2", "lesson": 12, "book": "HSK2", "title_zh": "你穿得太少了", "title_pinyin": "Nǐ chuān de tài shǎo le", "title_en": "You wear too little", "textbook": {"ref": {"book": "textbook", "pages": [109, 110, 111, 112, 113, 114, 115, 116]}, "warmup": [{"instruction_zh": "给下面的词语选择对应的图片", "instruction_en": "Match the pictures with the words/phrases.", "items": ["①妻子 qīzi", "②睡觉 shuì jiào", "③房间 fángjiān", "④下雪 xià xuě", "⑤起床 qǐ chuáng", "⑥房子 fángzi"], "pictures_desc_en": ["A: a modern living room with white sofas, a glass coffee table and a fireplace", "B: a smiling bride holding a bouquet of orange roses, embracing a man in a dark suit", "F (top right, third picture): a smiling woman sitting up in bed stretching both arms up", "D: a young woman sleeping with her head on a white pillow", "E: snow-covered trees on a mountain under a blue sky", "F (bottom right, sixth picture): a two-storey blue-and-white house with a porch"]}, {"instruction_zh": "给下面的动词加上合适的宾语", "instruction_en": "Add an appropriate object after each of the following verbs.", "items": ["例如：学 汉语 xué Hànyǔ", "说________ shuō", "开________ kāi", "准备________ zhǔnbèi", "读________ dú", "找________ zhǎo", "学习________ xuéxí"]}], "pronunciation": [{"title_zh": "选择问句的句调", "rows": ["Nǐ xǐhuan chī mǐfàn háishi chī miàntiáo? （1）你喜欢吃米饭还是吃面条？↘［重读点：米饭、面条］", "Nǐ xiǎng jīntiān qù háishi míngtiān qù? （2）你想今天去还是明天去？↘［重读点：今天、明天］", "Nǐ qù xuéxiào shì kāi chē háishi zuò chē? （3）你去学校是开车还是坐车？↘［重读点：开车、坐车］"], "notes_zh": ["句中供选择的部分重读，前一部分读升调，语速较慢，后一部分读降调。例如：", "［重读点］为书中汉字下的红点所标示的字；“↘”为书中句末的弯曲下降箭头（书中无文字说明）。"], "notes_en": ["Intonation of an Alternative Question", "The alternatives are stressed, the former is a bit slow in a rising intonation and the latter in a falling intonation. For example:"]}], "texts": [{"n": 1, "title_zh": "在教室", "title_en": "In the classroom", "kind": "dialogue", "lines": [{"speaker": "A", "zh": "你每天早上几点起床？", "pinyin": "Nǐ měi tiān zǎoshang jǐ diǎn qǐ chuáng?"}, {"speaker": "B", "zh": "六点多。", "pinyin": "Liù diǎn duō."}, {"speaker": "A", "zh": "你比我早起一个小时。", "pinyin": "Nǐ bǐ wǒ zǎo qǐ yí ge xiǎoshí."}, {"speaker": "B", "zh": "我睡得也早，我每天晚上十点就睡觉。早睡早起身体好。", "pinyin": "Wǒ shuì de yě zǎo, wǒ měi tiān wǎnshang shí diǎn jiù shuì jiào. Zǎo shuì zǎo qǐ shēntǐ hǎo."}], "english_version": "A: When do you get up every morning?\nB: A few minutes past six.\nA: You get up one hour earlier than I do.\nB: I go to bed early also, at 10 o’clock every night. It’s healthy to keep early hours.", "new_words": [{"n": 1, "zh": "得", "pinyin": "de", "pos": "part.", "en": "used after a verb or an adjective to introduce a complement of result or degree", "text": 1}]}, {"n": 2, "title_zh": "在朋友家", "title_en": "At a friend’s home", "kind": "dialogue", "lines": [{"speaker": "A", "zh": "再来点儿米饭吧，你吃得太少了。", "pinyin": "Zài lái diǎnr mǐfàn ba, nǐ chī de tài shǎo le."}, {"speaker": "B", "zh": "不少了，今天吃得很好，太谢谢你了。", "pinyin": "Bù shǎo le, jīntiān chī de hěn hǎo, tài xièxie nǐ le."}, {"speaker": "A", "zh": "你做饭做得怎么样？", "pinyin": "Nǐ zuò fàn zuò de zěnmeyàng?"}, {"speaker": "B", "zh": "不怎么样，我妻子比我做得好。", "pinyin": "Bù zěnmeyàng, wǒ qīzi bǐ wǒ zuò de hǎo."}], "english_version": "A: Have more rice, please. You ate too little.\nB: Not a little actually. I’ve enjoyed the meal a lot. Thank you so much.\nA: How well can you cook?\nB: Not very well. My wife is a better cook than I am.", "new_words": [{"n": 2, "zh": "妻子", "pinyin": "qīzi", "pos": "n.", "en": "wife", "text": 2}]}, {"n": 3, "title_zh": "在家门口", "title_en": "At the door of the house", "kind": "dialogue", "lines": [{"speaker": "A", "zh": "下雪了，今天真冷。", "pinyin": "Xià xuě le, jīntiān zhēn lěng."}, {"speaker": "B", "zh": "有零下10度吧？", "pinyin": "Yǒu líng xià shí dù ba?"}, {"speaker": "A", "zh": "是啊，你穿得太少了，我们进房间吧。", "pinyin": "Shì a, nǐ chuān de tài shǎo le, wǒmen jìn fángjiān ba."}, {"speaker": "B", "zh": "好吧。", "pinyin": "Hǎo ba."}], "english_version": "A: It’s snowing. It’s really cold today.\nB: The temperature may be 10 degrees below zero, am I right?\nA: Yes. You wear too little. Let’s go inside the house, OK?\nB: OK.", "new_words": [{"n": 3, "zh": "雪", "pinyin": "xuě", "pos": "n.", "en": "snow", "text": 3}, {"n": 4, "zh": "零", "pinyin": "líng", "pos": "num.", "en": "zero", "text": 3}, {"n": 5, "zh": "度", "pinyin": "dù", "pos": "n.", "en": "degree", "star": true, "text": 3}, {"n": 6, "zh": "穿", "pinyin": "chuān", "pos": "v.", "en": "to wear, to put on", "text": 3}, {"n": 7, "zh": "进", "pinyin": "jìn", "pos": "v.", "en": "to enter, to come/go in", "text": 3}]}, {"n": 4, "title_zh": "在家里", "title_en": "At home", "kind": "dialogue", "lines": [{"speaker": "A", "zh": "你在忙什么呢？", "pinyin": "Nǐ zài máng shénme ne?"}, {"speaker": "B", "zh": "我弟弟让我帮他找个房子，现在他家离公司有点儿远。", "pinyin": "Wǒ dìdi ràng wǒ bāng tā zhǎo ge fángzi, xiànzài tā jiā lí gōngsī yǒudiǎnr yuǎn."}, {"speaker": "A", "zh": "住得远真的很累！", "pinyin": "Zhù de yuǎn zhēn de hěn lèi!"}, {"speaker": "B", "zh": "是啊，他也希望能住得近一点儿。", "pinyin": "Shì a, tā yě xīwàng néng zhù de jìn yìdiǎnr."}], "english_version": "A: What are you busy with?\nB: My younger brother asked me to find an apartment for him. He now lives far from the company.\nA: It’s really exhausting to live far.\nB: It’s true. He also wants to live nearer.", "new_words": [{"n": 8, "zh": "弟弟", "pinyin": "dìdi", "pos": "n.", "en": "younger brother", "text": 4}, {"n": 9, "zh": "近", "pinyin": "jìn", "pos": "adj.", "en": "near, close", "text": 4}]}], "grammar": [{"n": 1, "title_zh": "程度补语", "title_en": "Complements of Degree", "explanation_zh": "程度补语是用来表示程度的，在形式上常用结构助词“得”连接程度补语，补充、说明动作进行的程度或事物性质、状态所达到的程度。也有不用“得”连接的情况。例如：\n如果有宾语时，要把宾语提前，或者重复动词。例如：\n表示否定时，要把否定词放在结构助词“得”的后边。例如：\n程度补语的疑问形式是在结构助词“得”的后面使用“Adj + 不 + Adj”，构成正反疑问句。例如：", "explanation_en": "A complement of degree describes the degree of something. The structural particle “得” is often used to introduce a complement of degree which makes remarks on the extent or degree an action or the quality or state of something has reached. Sometimes “得” is not used. For example:\nIf the verb takes an object, the object should be put before the verb, or the verb be reduplicated. For example:\nIn the negative form, the negative word should be put after the structural particle “得”. For example:\nIn the interrogative form, “得” is followed by the structure “Adj + 不 + Adj”, forming an affirmative-negative sentence. For example:", "structure_rows": ["Subject | Predicate: V | 得 | Adj", "他 | 说 | 得 | 很好。", "我 | 起 | 得 | 很早。", "我 | 睡 | 得 | 也早。", "Subject | Predicate: （V + ）O | V | 得 | Adj", "他 | （说）汉语 | 说 | 得 | 很好。", "我 | （写）汉字 | 写 | 得 | 很好。", "姐姐 | （唱）歌 | 唱 | 得 | 不错。", "Subject | Predicate: V | 得 | 不 + Adj", "他 | 说 | 得 | 不好。", "我 | 起 | 得 | 不早。", "我 | 住 | 得 | 不远。", "Subject | Predicate: （V + ）O | V | 得 | 不 + Adj", "他 | （说）汉语 | 说 | 得 | 不好。", "我 | （写）汉字 | 写 | 得 | 不好。", "姐姐 | （唱）歌 | 唱 | 得 | 不太好。", "Subject | Predicate: V | 得 | Adj + 不 + Adj", "他 | 说 | 得 | 好不好？", "姐姐 | 起 | 得 | 早不早？", "你 | 住 | 得 | 远不远？"], "examples": [{"n": 1, "zh": "他说得很好。"}, {"n": 2, "zh": "我起得很早。"}, {"n": 3, "zh": "我睡得也早。"}, {"n": 4, "zh": "他（说）汉语说得很好。"}, {"n": 5, "zh": "我（写）汉字写得很好。"}, {"n": 6, "zh": "姐姐（唱）歌唱得不错。"}, {"n": 7, "zh": "他说得不好。"}, {"n": 8, "zh": "我起得不早。"}, {"n": 9, "zh": "我住得不远。"}, {"n": 10, "zh": "他（说）汉语说得不好。"}, {"n": 11, "zh": "我（写）汉字写得不好。"}, {"n": 12, "zh": "姐姐（唱）歌唱得不太好。"}, {"n": 13, "zh": "他说得好不好？"}, {"n": 14, "zh": "姐姐起得早不早？"}, {"n": 15, "zh": "你住得远不远？"}]}, {"n": 2, "title_zh": "“比”字句（2）", "title_en": "The “比” Sentence (2)", "explanation_zh": "如果动词带程度补语，“比”可以放在动词前，也可放在补语前。例如：", "explanation_en": "If a verb takes a complement of degree, “比” can be put before the verb or the complement. For example:", "structure_rows": ["A | 比 | B | V + 得 + Adj", "他 | 比 | 我 | 学得好。", "姐姐 | 比 | 我 | 跑得快。", "我妻子 | 比 | 我 | 做得好。", "A | V + 得 | 比 | B | Adj", "他 | 学得 | 比 | 我 | 好。", "姐姐 | 跑得 | 比 | 我 | 快。", "我妻子 | 做得 | 比 | 我 | 好。"], "examples": [{"n": 1, "zh": "他比我学得好。"}, {"n": 2, "zh": "姐姐比我跑得快。"}, {"n": 3, "zh": "我妻子比我做得好。"}, {"n": 4, "zh": "他学得比我好。"}, {"n": 5, "zh": "姐姐跑得比我快。"}, {"n": 6, "zh": "我妻子做得比我好。"}]}], "exercises": [{"n": 1, "type_zh": "分角色朗读课文", "instruction_zh": "分角色朗读课文", "instruction_en": "Role-play the dialogs.", "items": []}, {"n": 2, "type_zh": "回答问题", "instruction_zh": "根据课文内容回答问题", "instruction_en": "Answer the questions based on the dialogs.", "items": [{"n": 1, "zh": "她为什么每天晚上十点就睡觉？", "pinyin": "Tā wèi shénme měi tiān wǎnshang shí diǎn jiù shuì jiào?"}, {"n": 2, "zh": "他们家谁做饭做得好？", "pinyin": "Tāmen jiā shéi zuò fàn zuò de hǎo?"}, {"n": 3, "zh": "今天天气怎么样？", "pinyin": "Jīntiān tiānqì zěnmeyàng?"}, {"n": 4, "zh": "她这两天在忙什么呢？", "pinyin": "Tā zhè liǎng tiān zài máng shénme ne?"}, {"n": 5, "zh": "她弟弟为什么要找新的房子？", "pinyin": "Tā dìdi wèi shénme yào zhǎo xīn de fángzi?"}]}, {"n": 3, "type_zh": "描述图片", "instruction_zh": "用本课新学的语言点和词语描述图片", "instruction_en": "Describe the pictures using the newly-learned language points and words.", "items": [{"n": 1, "zh": "她唱得________。", "pinyin": "Tā chàng de ______.", "picture_desc_en": "a young woman singing with her eyes closed into a microphone"}, {"n": 2, "zh": "爸爸开车开得________。", "pinyin": "Bàba kāi chē kāi de ______.", "picture_desc_en": "a smiling man in a suit driving a car, hands on the steering wheel"}, {"n": 3, "zh": "哥哥比我吃得________。", "pinyin": "Gēge bǐ wǒ chī de ______.", "picture_desc_en": "a man lying down eating potato chips from a bowl held on his chest"}, {"n": 4, "zh": "爸爸比妈妈做饭做得________。", "pinyin": "Bàba bǐ māma zuò fàn zuò de ______.", "picture_desc_en": "a young man grilling food on an outdoor barbecue, with two women sitting behind him"}]}], "characters": {"knowledge_title_zh": "汉字偏旁“止”和“冂”", "knowledge_zh": "偏旁 | 解释 | 例字\n止 | 止字旁，一般与脚趾有关。 | 趾 zhǐ、步 bù\n冂 | 同字头，一般与一些事物的关系和形象有关。 | 同 tóng、网 wǎng", "knowledge_en": "Chinese Radicals: “止” and “冂” — The radical “止” is usually related to toes: 趾 zhǐ toe; 步 bù step. The radical “冂” usually has something to do with relations among or images of things: 同 tóng same; 网 wǎng net.", "characters": [{"zh": "趾", "pinyin": "zhǐ", "note_zh": "偏旁“止（止字旁）”例字（toe）"}, {"zh": "步", "pinyin": "bù", "note_zh": "偏旁“止（止字旁）”例字（step）"}, {"zh": "同", "pinyin": "tóng", "note_zh": "偏旁“冂（同字头）”例字（same）"}, {"zh": "网", "pinyin": "wǎng", "note_zh": "偏旁“冂（同字头）”例字（net）"}]}, "application": [{"title_zh": "双人活动", "instruction_zh": "两人一组，用带助词“得”的程度补语练习说句子，尽量使用所给出的词语。", "instruction_en": "Work in pairs and make sentences with complements of degree using “得”. Use as many given words as possible.", "example_zh": ["例如：他跑得很快。 Tā pǎo de hěn kuài.", "我跑得不快。 Wǒ pǎo de bú kuài.", "词语框 动词 Verbs：学 xué、走 zǒu、写 xiě、读 dú、下 xià、起床 qǐ chuáng、睡觉 shuì jiào、准备 zhǔnbèi", "词语框 形容词 Adjectives：好 hǎo、快 kuài、漂亮 piàoliang、不错 búcuò、慢 màn、大 dà"]}, {"title_zh": "小组活动", "instruction_zh": "4~5人一组，进行“比”字句接龙的游戏。要求使用“A比B + V + 得 + Adj”或“A + V + 得 + 比B + Adj”两种句型。", "instruction_en": "Work in groups of 4-5 and say sentences with “比” in relays. Use either “A比B + V + 得 + Adj” or “A + V + 得 + 比B + Adj”.", "example_zh": ["例如：王方：我比大卫跑得快。 Wǒ bǐ Dàwèi pǎo de kuài.", "大卫：我唱得比安妮好。 Wǒ chàng de bǐ Ānni hǎo."]}]}, "teacher": {"ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [87, 88, 89, 90, 91, 92, 93]}, "objectives_zh": ["重点词语：学生能够熟练掌握“雪、零、穿、进、近”的词义和用法", "语言点：学生能够了解并掌握：（1）状态补语（2）“比”字句（2）", "语音：学生能够掌握选择问句的句调，并能正确朗读", "汉字：学生能够：（1）熟练认读本课生词（2）了解“止（止字旁）、冂（同字框）”所表示的意思", "功能：学生能够：（1）对结果、程度、状态等进行描写、判断和评价（状态补语）（2）比较事物的性质、程度的差别和高低（“比”字句）"], "steps": [{"title_zh": "一 复习旧课", "body_zh": "1. 教师出示第11课生词卡片，要求学生快速认读下列生词：\n唱歌、孩子、右边、便宜、说话、可能、去年\n2. 教师带领学生辨析下列字形相近的汉字：\n哥____　这____　左____　年____\n歌____　边____　右____　牛____\n3. 教师根据第11课重点内容，让学生用“比”字句回答下列问题（可利用图片）：\n昨天25度，今天28度。\n昨天比今天________。\n西瓜三块五，苹果五块。\n西瓜没有苹果________。\n我25岁，哥哥27岁。\n我比哥哥________。\n昨天的考试我有两个题不会写，小王都会写。\n我的学习没有小王________。\n我们班有23个学生，大卫他们班有19个学生。\n我们班的学生比他们班________。\n红色的衣服800块，白色的650块。\n红色的衣服比白色的________。"}, {"title_zh": "二 学习新课 1 热身", "body_zh": "热身1：教师先带领学生根据图片选出正确的词语，然后分组练习。一组学生看图片说出正确的词语；另一组学生看词语，说出图片的编号。\n答案：①B　②D　③A　④E　⑤C　⑥F\n热身2：教师可以先让学生自己完成，然后请学生说出自己的答案。教师要鼓励学生说出不同的答案。\n例如：说话　说汉语　说英语　……"}, {"title_zh": "2 生词", "body_zh": "（1）生词快速认读及正音\n得、妻子、雪、零、度、穿、进、弟弟、近\n• 教师可以用PPT依次快速展示生词；\n• 教师领读，学生齐读；\n• 学生接龙式读一遍，每人读两个。\n（2）重点生词扩展及常用搭配\n雪—大雪—小雪—下雪—下大雪—下了一天雪\n　—明天有大雪，你要多穿点儿衣服。\n　—昨天下了一天雪。今天不下了。\n　—下雪了，今天真冷。\n零—零度—零上10度—零下1度\n　—昨天很冷，外边只有零度。\n　—北京今天零上5度，不太冷。\n　—今天有零下10度吧？\n穿—穿衣服—穿上—穿好—穿得少\n　—孩子太小，还不会穿衣服呢。\n　—已经八点多了，快点儿穿好衣服起床。\n　—你穿得太少了。\n进—进房间—进门—进教室—进图书馆\n　—爸爸刚下飞机就去公司开会了。\n　—我看见大卫一个人进图书馆了。\n　—你穿得太少了，我们进房间吧。\n近—很近—太近了—不太近—近一点儿\n　—我家离学校很近，我每天走路去上课。\n　—考试的时候你们两个不能坐得太近。\n　—他也希望能住得近一点儿。\n练习册相关练习：第106页／一／第一部分，第109-110页／二／第一、二部分"}, {"title_zh": "3 语言点（1）状态补语", "body_zh": "① 语言点解析：\n状态补语主要指动词后用“得”连接的表示动作结果、状态的补语。状态补语主要是对动作进行描写、评价或判断，大多由形容词或形容词短语充当，一般在形容词前要加“很”。\n［句型框］主语＋动词＋得＋形容词\n［句型框］主语＋（动词）＋宾语＋动词＋得＋形容词\n② 语言点导入：\n教师可以根据班里的实际情况，用真实的情境提问，导入语言点。\n教师：王方汉字写得好不好？\n学生：王方汉字写得很好。\n教师：大卫呢？\n学生：大卫写得不好。\n③ 语言点操练：\n教师让学生大声朗读下列句子，并用肯定式和否定式回答。\n他汉语说得好不好？\n你住得远不远？\n大卫跑得快不快？\n王方唱得好听不好听？\n④ 语言点扩展练习：\n教师带领学生做课本第95页的双人活动。"}, {"title_zh": "3 语言点（2）“比”字句（2）", "body_zh": "① 语言点解析：\n“比”字句中的谓语除了可以是形容词外，还可以是一般动词，后面带形容词充当的状态补语，“比”可以放在动词前，也可以放在补语前。\n［句型框］A＋比＋B＋动词＋得＋形容词\n［句型框］A＋动词＋得＋比＋B＋形容词\n② 语言点导入：\n教师可以提供图片或者语境，让学生用语言点说出句子。可以找一张两个人跑步的图片（一快一慢）做提示，也可以根据本班的实际情况，用学生们唱歌、写汉字等方面的情况做比较。\n教师：王方跑得快不快？大卫呢？\n学生：大卫比王方跑得快。\n教师：大卫唱歌怎么样？王方呢？\n学生：王方比大卫唱得好。\n③ 语言点操练：\n教师让学生先听句子，然后快速回答问题。\n我比他说得好。谁说得好？________。\n他住得比我远。谁家远？________。\n大卫比我写得快。谁写得快？________。\n王方没有我起得早。谁起得早？________。\n④ 语言点扩展练习：\n• 教师带领学生做课本第96页的小组活动。\n• 完成课本第94页练习部分的第三题。"}, {"title_zh": "4 课文", "body_zh": "课文1\n（1）让学生听两遍录音并回答下列问题：\n女的每天早上起得早不早？\n男的每天早上几点起床？\n女的每天睡得早不早？\n女的每天睡几个小时？\n（2）教师领读课文两遍，然后让学生分角色朗读课文。\n（3）教师用PPT展示课文提示词，请学生再次通读一遍课文后，根据提示词复述课文。\nA：你每天早上……？\nB：六点多。\nA：你比我……。\nB：我……，我每天……。……身体好。\n（4）让学生用女的的口气把本段对话改为叙述体。\n我每天……，我的朋友……，我每天晚上，我觉得……。\n课文2\n（1）让学生听两遍录音并回答下列问题：\n女的和男的在哪儿聊天呢？\n女的为什么让男的再吃点儿米饭？\n男的想不想再吃点儿米饭？\n男的做饭怎么样？\n（2）教师带领学生齐读课文两遍，然后请学生分角色朗读课文。\n（3）教师用PPT展示课文提示词，请学生再次通读一遍课文后，根据提示词复述课文。\nA：再……吧，你吃得……。\nB：不少了，今天……，太谢谢你了。\nA：你做饭……？\nB：……，我妻子……。\n（4）请学生根据课文内容，自己设计情景，进行角色扮演。\n课文3\n（1）让学生听两遍录音并回答下列问题：\n今天天气怎么样？\n今天几度？\n女的为什么让男的进房间？\n（2）教师带领学生齐读课文两遍，然后请学生分角色朗读课文。\n（3）教师用PPT展示课文提示词，请学生再次通读一遍课文后，根据提示词复述课文。\nA：……，今天真冷。\nB：有……吧？\nA：是啊，你……了，我们……吧。\nB：好吧。\n课文4\n（1）让学生听两遍录音并回答下列问题：\nB在做什么呢？\nB的弟弟为什么要找房子？\n家离公司远，好不好？\nB的弟弟希望找一个什么样的房子？\n（2）教师带领学生齐读课文两遍，然后请学生分角色朗读课文。\n（3）教师用PPT展示课文提示词，请学生再次通读一遍课文后，根据提示词复述课文。\nA：你在……呢？\nB：我弟弟……，现在他家……。\nA：住得远……！\nB：是啊，他也希望……。"}, {"title_zh": "5 语音", "body_zh": "选择问句的句调：\n① 知识点解析\n选择疑问句是指提出两个或两个以上可能的答案供对方选择的句式。这一类疑问句通常都是前面供选择的答案用低升调，最后一个用降调。\n你想喝茶还是喝咖啡？↘［重读点：茶、咖啡］\n你们的语法老师是去年来的还是今年来的？↘［重读点：去年、今年］\n星期天我们一起去看电影、唱歌还是吃饭？↘［重读点：电影、唱歌、吃饭］\n② 语音练习\n教师可利用课本第95页的例句进行练习。教师可先领读句子，使学生掌握选择问句的句调特点，然后让学生个别读，教师纠正错误。\n练习册相关练习：第113页／三"}, {"title_zh": "6 汉字", "body_zh": "① 知识点解析：\n偏旁\n止：止字旁，由它构成的汉字一般与脚趾有关系。\n冂：同字框，由它构成的汉字一般与事物的关系和形象有关系。\n② 汉字练习：\n• 教师板书本课偏旁“止、冂”，提示学生注意这两个偏旁的笔画和笔顺，并书写各自的代表汉字，帮助学生识记该偏旁的意义。\n• 补充练习\na. 找出下列含有止字旁和同字框的汉字\n问　同　网　跑\n步　此　址　间\nb. 拆分下列汉字\n得：____　____　零：____　____\n穿：____　____　近：____　____\nc. 用下列偏旁和部件组合成新汉字\n雨　反　井　彐　辶　穴　牙　饣\n____　____　____　____\n练习册相关练习：第114页／四"}, {"title_zh": "7 补充课堂活动——给你一个建议", "body_zh": "请每个学生给别人一个建议，或者提出一个希望。可以参考下列句子。\n例如：\n天气很热，你穿得太多了。\n你的手机太旧了，应该买一个新的。\n我希望你每天来上课。\n……"}, {"title_zh": "8 本课小结", "body_zh": "• 语言点：状态补语\n　“比”字句（2）\n• 语音：选择问句的句调\n• 汉字：偏旁“止、冂”"}, {"title_zh": "附注：建议教学用具", "body_zh": "1. 生词卡片：第11、12课生词卡片\n2. 图片：两个人跑步（一快一慢）"}], "notes_zh": [], "warmup_answers_zh": ["热身1 答案：①B　②D　③A　④E　⑤C　⑥F", "热身2 例如：说话　说汉语　说英语　……"], "text_questions": [{"text": 1, "q_zh": "女的每天早上起得早不早？"}, {"text": 1, "q_zh": "男的每天早上几点起床？"}, {"text": 1, "q_zh": "女的每天睡得早不早？"}, {"text": 1, "q_zh": "女的每天睡几个小时？"}, {"text": 2, "q_zh": "女的和男的在哪儿聊天呢？"}, {"text": 2, "q_zh": "女的为什么让男的再吃点儿米饭？"}, {"text": 2, "q_zh": "男的想不想再吃点儿米饭？"}, {"text": 2, "q_zh": "男的做饭怎么样？"}, {"text": 3, "q_zh": "今天天气怎么样？"}, {"text": 3, "q_zh": "今天几度？"}, {"text": 3, "q_zh": "女的为什么让男的进房间？"}, {"text": 4, "q_zh": "B在做什么呢？"}, {"text": 4, "q_zh": "B的弟弟为什么要找房子？"}, {"text": 4, "q_zh": "家离公司远，好不好？"}, {"text": 4, "q_zh": "B的弟弟希望找一个什么样的房子？"}], "summary_zh": "• 语言点：状态补语\n　“比”字句（2）\n• 语音：选择问句的句调\n• 汉字：偏旁“止、冂”"}, "workbook": {"ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [114, 115, 116, 117, 118, 119, 120, 121, 122]}, "sections": [{"n": "一、听力 第一部分", "type_zh": "听力 第一部分", "instruction_zh": "第1–5题：听句子，判断对错", "instruction_en": "Questions 1-5: Decide whether the pictures are right or wrong based on the sentences you hear.", "items": [{"n": "例1", "zh": "我们家有三个人。", "pinyin": "Wǒmen jiā yǒu sān ge rén.", "transcript_zh": "我们家有三个人。", "picture_desc_en": "a smiling family outdoors: a man carrying a child on his shoulders and a woman", "answer": "√", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [114]}}, {"n": "例2", "zh": "我每天坐公共汽车去上班。", "pinyin": "Wǒ měi tiān zuò gōnggòngqìchē qù shàng bān.", "transcript_zh": "我每天坐公共汽车去上班。", "picture_desc_en": "a mountain bicycle", "answer": "×", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [114]}}, {"n": 1, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "你今天起得真早。", "picture_desc_en": "a smiling man lying in bed asleep, his head on a pillow", "answer": "×", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 2, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "再来点儿米饭吧，你吃得太少了。", "picture_desc_en": "a young woman eating noodles from a bowl with chopsticks", "answer": "×", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 3, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "下雪了，今天真冷。", "picture_desc_en": "traditional Chinese buildings with roofs covered in snow", "answer": "√", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 4, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "我觉得很热，今天穿得太多了。", "picture_desc_en": "a smiling man in a white T-shirt taking off his jacket outdoors", "answer": "√", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 5, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "这件衣服比弟弟送给我的那件漂亮。", "picture_desc_en": "a pair of canvas sneakers", "answer": "×", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}, {"n": "一、听力 第二部分", "type_zh": "听力 第二部分", "instruction_zh": "第6–10题：听对话，选择与对话内容一致的图片", "instruction_en": "Questions 6-10: Choose the right picture for each dialogue you hear.", "items": [{"n": "例", "zh": "男：你喜欢什么运动？ Nǐ xǐhuan shénme yùndòng? (What sport do you like?) 女：我最喜欢踢足球。 Wǒ zuì xǐhuan tī zúqiú. (My favorite sport is playing football.)", "transcript_zh": "男：你喜欢什么运动？ 女：我最喜欢踢足球。", "options": {"A": "[picture] a dark, cloudy sky", "B": "[picture] a smiling woman in an apron cooking at a stove in a kitchen", "C": "[picture] a smiling young woman with a backpack holding a folder", "D": "[picture] a young woman juggling a football on her knee on a field", "E": "[picture] a woman running along a city street past taxis", "F": "[picture] a woman lying in bed reaching for an alarm clock"}, "answer": "D", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [115]}}, {"n": 6, "zh": "", "options": {"A": "[picture] a dark, cloudy sky", "B": "[picture] a smiling woman in an apron cooking at a stove in a kitchen", "C": "[picture] a smiling young woman with a backpack holding a folder", "D": "[picture] a young woman juggling a football on her knee on a field", "E": "[picture] a woman running along a city street past taxis", "F": "[picture] a woman lying in bed reaching for an alarm clock"}, "transcript_zh": "男：我今天早上七点就起床了。 女：你比我早起一个小时呢。", "answer": "F", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 7, "zh": "", "options": {"A": "[picture] a dark, cloudy sky", "B": "[picture] a smiling woman in an apron cooking at a stove in a kitchen", "C": "[picture] a smiling young woman with a backpack holding a folder", "D": "[picture] a young woman juggling a football on her knee on a field", "E": "[picture] a woman running along a city street past taxis", "F": "[picture] a woman lying in bed reaching for an alarm clock"}, "transcript_zh": "女：你做饭做得怎么样？ 男：不怎么样，我妻子比我做得好。", "answer": "B", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 8, "zh": "", "options": {"A": "[picture] a dark, cloudy sky", "B": "[picture] a smiling woman in an apron cooking at a stove in a kitchen", "C": "[picture] a smiling young woman with a backpack holding a folder", "D": "[picture] a young woman juggling a football on her knee on a field", "E": "[picture] a woman running along a city street past taxis", "F": "[picture] a woman lying in bed reaching for an alarm clock"}, "transcript_zh": "男：今天天气真冷啊！ 女：是啊，我觉得晚上可能下雪。", "answer": "A", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 9, "zh": "", "options": {"A": "[picture] a dark, cloudy sky", "B": "[picture] a smiling woman in an apron cooking at a stove in a kitchen", "C": "[picture] a smiling young woman with a backpack holding a folder", "D": "[picture] a young woman juggling a football on her knee on a field", "E": "[picture] a woman running along a city street past taxis", "F": "[picture] a woman lying in bed reaching for an alarm clock"}, "transcript_zh": "女：大卫很喜欢跑步。 男：是啊，他跑得非常快。", "answer": "E", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 10, "zh": "", "options": {"A": "[picture] a dark, cloudy sky", "B": "[picture] a smiling woman in an apron cooking at a stove in a kitchen", "C": "[picture] a smiling young woman with a backpack holding a folder", "D": "[picture] a young woman juggling a football on her knee on a field", "E": "[picture] a woman running along a city street past taxis", "F": "[picture] a woman lying in bed reaching for an alarm clock"}, "transcript_zh": "男：你今天穿得真漂亮。 女：谢谢，今天是我的生日。", "answer": "C", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}, {"n": "一、听力 第三部分", "type_zh": "听力 第三部分", "instruction_zh": "第11–15题：听对话，选择正确答案", "instruction_en": "Questions 11-15: Listen to the dialogues and answer the questions.", "items": [{"n": "例", "zh": "问：小王的杯子是什么颜色的？", "pinyin": "Xiǎo Wáng de bēizi shì shénme yánsè de?", "transcript_zh": "男：小王，这里有几个杯子，哪个是你的？ 女：左边那个红色的是我的。 问：小王的杯子是什么颜色的？", "options": {"A": "红色 hóngsè red", "B": "黑色 hēisè black", "C": "白色 báisè white"}, "answer": "A", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [116]}}, {"n": 11, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "男：你每天几点睡觉？ 女：我每天十点就睡觉了，早睡早起身体好。 问：女的为什么睡得很早？", "options": {"A": "学习好 xuéxí hǎo", "B": "太累了 tài lèi le", "C": "对身体好 duì shēntǐ hǎo"}, "answer": "C", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 12, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "男：明天天气怎么样？ 女：零下十度，比今天冷多了。你要多穿点儿衣服。 问：明天冷吗？", "options": {"A": "很冷 hěn lěng", "B": "不太冷 bú tài lěng", "C": "很热 hěn rè"}, "answer": "A", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 13, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "女：你们家谁做饭做得好？ 男：我做得还可以，我妻子做的比我好吃。 问：谁做饭做得最好？", "options": {"A": "男的 nán de", "B": "男的的妻子 nán de de qīzi", "C": "女的 nǚ de"}, "answer": "B", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 14, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "男：你这几天在忙什么呢？ 女：我弟弟让我帮他找个房子，他家离公司有点儿远。 问：她弟弟为什么要找个房子？", "options": {"A": "离公司远 lí gōngsī yuǎn", "B": "工作太累 gōngzuò tài lèi", "C": "离家有点儿远 lí jiā yǒudiǎnr yuǎn"}, "answer": "A", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 15, "zh": "", "transcript_zh": "男：儿子这次考试考得怎么样？ 女：还不错，比上次好一些。 问：儿子考得怎么样？", "options": {"A": "不太好 bú tài hǎo", "B": "非常好 fēicháng hǎo", "C": "还可以 hái kěyǐ"}, "answer": "C", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}, {"n": "二、阅读 第一部分", "type_zh": "阅读 第一部分", "instruction_zh": "第16–20题：看图片，选择与句子内容一致的图片", "instruction_en": "Questions 16-20: Choose the right picture for each sentence.", "items": [{"n": "例", "zh": "每个星期六，我都去打篮球。", "pinyin": "Měi ge xīngqīliù, wǒ dōu qù dǎ lánqiú.", "options": {"A": "[picture] a woman helping a little girl put on clothes", "B": "[picture] a girl singing energetically into a microphone, one arm outstretched", "C": "[picture] a man carrying a wicker basket full of laundry", "D": "[picture] a smiling young man holding a basketball above his head", "E": "[picture] a little boy typing on a laptop with his face close to the screen", "F": "[picture] a man in a suit with a briefcase walking and talking on a mobile phone"}, "answer": "D", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [117]}}, {"n": 16, "zh": "别离电脑太近，对眼睛不好。", "pinyin": "Bié lí diànnǎo tài jìn, duì yǎnjing bù hǎo.", "options": {"A": "[picture] a woman helping a little girl put on clothes", "B": "[picture] a girl singing energetically into a microphone, one arm outstretched", "C": "[picture] a man carrying a wicker basket full of laundry", "D": "[picture] a smiling young man holding a basketball above his head", "E": "[picture] a little boy typing on a laptop with his face close to the screen", "F": "[picture] a man in a suit with a briefcase walking and talking on a mobile phone"}, "answer": "E", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 17, "zh": "妻子这几天很忙，所以我洗衣服。", "pinyin": "Qīzi zhè jǐ tiān hěn máng, suǒyǐ wǒ xǐ yīfu.", "options": {"A": "[picture] a woman helping a little girl put on clothes", "B": "[picture] a girl singing energetically into a microphone, one arm outstretched", "C": "[picture] a man carrying a wicker basket full of laundry", "D": "[picture] a smiling young man holding a basketball above his head", "E": "[picture] a little boy typing on a laptop with his face close to the screen", "F": "[picture] a man in a suit with a briefcase walking and talking on a mobile phone"}, "answer": "C", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 18, "zh": "今天零下十度，比昨天冷多了。你多穿点儿衣服吧。", "pinyin": "Jīntiān língxià shí dù, bǐ zuótiān lěng duō le. Nǐ duō chuān diǎnr yīfu ba.", "options": {"A": "[picture] a woman helping a little girl put on clothes", "B": "[picture] a girl singing energetically into a microphone, one arm outstretched", "C": "[picture] a man carrying a wicker basket full of laundry", "D": "[picture] a smiling young man holding a basketball above his head", "E": "[picture] a little boy typing on a laptop with his face close to the screen", "F": "[picture] a man in a suit with a briefcase walking and talking on a mobile phone"}, "answer": "A", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 19, "zh": "你唱歌唱得太好了，再来一个吧。", "pinyin": "Nǐ chànggē chàng de tài hǎo le, zài lái yí ge ba.", "options": {"A": "[picture] a woman helping a little girl put on clothes", "B": "[picture] a girl singing energetically into a microphone, one arm outstretched", "C": "[picture] a man carrying a wicker basket full of laundry", "D": "[picture] a smiling young man holding a basketball above his head", "E": "[picture] a little boy typing on a laptop with his face close to the screen", "F": "[picture] a man in a suit with a briefcase walking and talking on a mobile phone"}, "answer": "B", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 20, "zh": "今天比昨天起得早，所以我走路去上班。", "pinyin": "Jīntiān bǐ zuótiān qǐ de zǎo, suǒyǐ wǒ zǒu lù qù shàng bān.", "options": {"A": "[picture] a woman helping a little girl put on clothes", "B": "[picture] a girl singing energetically into a microphone, one arm outstretched", "C": "[picture] a man carrying a wicker basket full of laundry", "D": "[picture] a smiling young man holding a basketball above his head", "E": "[picture] a little boy typing on a laptop with his face close to the screen", "F": "[picture] a man in a suit with a briefcase walking and talking on a mobile phone"}, "answer": "F", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}, {"n": "二、阅读 第二部分", "type_zh": "阅读 第二部分", "instruction_zh": "第21–25题：选择合适的词语填空", "instruction_en": "Questions 21-25: Choose the proper words to fill in the brackets.", "word_bank": [["A 穿 chuān", "B 进 jìn", "C 近 jìn", "D 让 ràng", "E 贵 guì", "F 希望 xīwàng"]], "items": [{"n": "例", "zh": "这儿的羊肉很好吃，但是也很（________）。", "pinyin": "Zhèr de yángròu hěn hǎochī, dànshì yě hěn ______.", "answer": "E", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [118]}}, {"n": 21, "zh": "他的家比我的家离公司（________）一点儿。", "pinyin": "Tā de jiā bǐ wǒ de jiā lí gōngsī ______ yìdiǎnr.", "answer": "C", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 22, "zh": "我（________）找一个比现在钱多一点儿的工作。", "pinyin": "Wǒ ______ zhǎo yí ge bǐ xiànzài qián duō yìdiǎnr de gōngzuò.", "answer": "F", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 23, "zh": "外面太冷了，快请（________）房间里来吧。", "pinyin": "Wàimian tài lěng le, kuài qǐng ______ fángjiān li lái ba.", "answer": "B", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 24, "zh": "明天有一个新年晚会，我想（________）得漂亮一点儿。", "pinyin": "Míngtiān yǒu yí ge xīnnián wǎnhuì, wǒ xiǎng ______ de piàoliang yìdiǎnr.", "answer": "A", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 25, "zh": "大卫生病了，他（________）我告诉王老师。", "pinyin": "Dàwèi shēng bìng le, tā ______ wǒ gàosu Wáng lǎoshī.", "answer": "D", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}, {"n": "二、阅读 第三部分", "type_zh": "阅读 第三部分", "instruction_zh": "第26–30题：判断下列句子的意思是否正确", "instruction_en": "Questions 26-30: Decide whether the inferences are true or false.", "items": [{"n": "例1", "zh": "现在是11点30分，他们已经游了20分钟了。 ★他们11点10分开始游泳。", "pinyin": "Xiànzài shì diǎn fēn, tāmen yǐjīng yóule fēnzhōng le. ★Tāmen diǎn fēn kāishǐ yóuyǒng.", "answer": "√", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [118]}}, {"n": "例2", "zh": "我会跳舞，但跳得不怎么样。 ★我跳得非常好。", "pinyin": "Wǒ huì tiàowǔ, dàn tiào de bù zěnmeyàng. ★Wǒ tiào de fēicháng hǎo.", "answer": "×", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [119]}}, {"n": 26, "zh": "今年没有去年冷，北京到现在还没下雪呢。去年这个时候已经下雪了。 ★北京今年比去年冷。", "pinyin": "Jīnnián méiyǒu qùnián lěng, Běijīng dào xiànzài hái méi xià xuě ne. Qùnián zhège shíhou yǐjīng xià xuě le. ★Běijīng jīnnián bǐ qùnián lěng.", "answer": "×", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 27, "zh": "你上个月没怎么运动吧？明天和我一起去踢足球怎么样？打篮球也可以。 ★他们可能明天一起运动。", "pinyin": "Nǐ shàng ge yuè méi zěnme yùndòng ba? Míngtiān hé wǒ yìqǐ qù tī zúqiú zěnmeyàng? Dǎ lánqiú yě kěyǐ. ★Tāmen kěnéng míngtiān yìqǐ yùndòng.", "answer": "√", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 28, "zh": "妻子每天睡觉前都要喝一杯牛奶，她说这样可以睡得好一些。 ★妻子起床后要喝牛奶。", "pinyin": "Qīzi měi tiān shuì jiào qián dōu yào hē yì bēi niúnǎi, tā shuō zhèyàng kěyǐ shuì de hǎo yìxiē. ★Qīzi qǐ chuáng hòu yào hē niúnǎi.", "answer": "×", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 29, "zh": "谢谢您，没有您的帮助，这件事情可能到今天晚上也做不完。 ★事情已经做完了。", "pinyin": "Xièxie nín, méiyǒu nín de bāngzhù, zhè jiàn shìqing kěnéng dào jīntiān wǎnshang yě zuò bu wán. ★Shìqing yǐjīng zuòwán le.", "answer": "√", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 30, "zh": "慢一点儿，你走得太快了，我们去那个茶馆喝杯茶好不好？ ★他想去喝茶。", "pinyin": "Màn yìdiǎnr, nǐ zǒu de tài kuài le, wǒmen qù nàge cháguǎn hē bēi chá hǎo bu hǎo? ★Tā xiǎng qù hē chá.", "answer": "√", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}, {"n": "二、阅读 第四部分", "type_zh": "阅读 第四部分", "instruction_zh": "第31–35题：选择合适的问答", "instruction_en": "Questions 31-35: Match the sentences to make dialogues.", "items": [{"n": "例", "zh": "他还在教室里学习。 (He is still studying in the classroom.)", "pinyin": "Tā hái zài jiàoshì li xuéxí.", "options": {"A": "路上车太多，坐公共汽车还没有走路快呢。 Lùshang chē tài duō, zuò gōnggòngqìchē hái méiyǒu zǒu lù kuài ne.", "B": "上个星期怎么没看到你？ Shàngge xīngqī zěnme méi kàndào nǐ?", "C": "天气太冷了，都零下十度了。 Tiānqì tài lěng le, dōu língxià shí dù le.", "D": "他比我游得快，但是没有大卫游得快。 Tā bǐ wǒ yóu de kuài, dànshì méiyǒu Dàwèi yóu de kuài.", "E": "他在哪儿呢？你看见他了吗？ Tā zài nǎr ne? Nǐ kànjiàn tā le ma?", "F": "住得远真的很累。 Zhù de yuǎn zhēn de hěn lèi."}, "answer": "E", "answer_ref": {"book": "workbook", "pages": [120]}}, {"n": 31, "zh": "你今天怎么穿得这么多？", "pinyin": "Nǐ jīntiān zěnme chuān de zhème duō?", "options": {"A": "路上车太多，坐公共汽车还没有走路快呢。 Lùshang chē tài duō, zuò gōnggòngqìchē hái méiyǒu zǒu lù kuài ne.", "B": "上个星期怎么没看到你？ Shàngge xīngqī zěnme méi kàndào nǐ?", "C": "天气太冷了，都零下十度了。 Tiānqì tài lěng le, dōu língxià shí dù le.", "D": "他比我游得快，但是没有大卫游得快。 Tā bǐ wǒ yóu de kuài, dànshì méiyǒu Dàwèi yóu de kuài.", "E": "他在哪儿呢？你看见他了吗？ Tā zài nǎr ne? Nǐ kànjiàn tā le ma?", "F": "住得远真的很累。 Zhù de yuǎn zhēn de hěn lèi."}, "answer": "C", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 32, "zh": "我每天要坐一个多小时的公共汽车去上班。", "pinyin": "Wǒ měi tiān yào zuò yí ge duō xiǎoshí de gōnggòngqìchē qù shàng bān.", "options": {"A": "路上车太多，坐公共汽车还没有走路快呢。 Lùshang chē tài duō, zuò gōnggòngqìchē hái méiyǒu zǒu lù kuài ne.", "B": "上个星期怎么没看到你？ Shàngge xīngqī zěnme méi kàndào nǐ?", "C": "天气太冷了，都零下十度了。 Tiānqì tài lěng le, dōu língxià shí dù le.", "D": "他比我游得快，但是没有大卫游得快。 Tā bǐ wǒ yóu de kuài, dànshì méiyǒu Dàwèi yóu de kuài.", "E": "他在哪儿呢？你看见他了吗？ Tā zài nǎr ne? Nǐ kànjiàn tā le ma?", "F": "住得远真的很累。 Zhù de yuǎn zhēn de hěn lèi."}, "answer": "F", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 33, "zh": "小王每天都游泳，他游得快吗？", "pinyin": "Xiǎo Wáng měi tiān dōu yóuyǒng, tā yóu de kuài ma?", "options": {"A": "路上车太多，坐公共汽车还没有走路快呢。 Lùshang chē tài duō, zuò gōnggòngqìchē hái méiyǒu zǒu lù kuài ne.", "B": "上个星期怎么没看到你？ Shàngge xīngqī zěnme méi kàndào nǐ?", "C": "天气太冷了，都零下十度了。 Tiānqì tài lěng le, dōu língxià shí dù le.", "D": "他比我游得快，但是没有大卫游得快。 Tā bǐ wǒ yóu de kuài, dànshì méiyǒu Dàwèi yóu de kuài.", "E": "他在哪儿呢？你看见他了吗？ Tā zài nǎr ne? Nǐ kànjiàn tā le ma?", "F": "住得远真的很累。 Zhù de yuǎn zhēn de hěn lèi."}, "answer": "D", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 34, "zh": "你每天坐公共汽车去学校吗？", "pinyin": "Nǐ měi tiān zuò gōnggòngqìchē qù xuéxiào ma?", "options": {"A": "路上车太多，坐公共汽车还没有走路快呢。 Lùshang chē tài duō, zuò gōnggòngqìchē hái méiyǒu zǒu lù kuài ne.", "B": "上个星期怎么没看到你？ Shàngge xīngqī zěnme méi kàndào nǐ?", "C": "天气太冷了，都零下十度了。 Tiānqì tài lěng le, dōu língxià shí dù le.", "D": "他比我游得快，但是没有大卫游得快。 Tā bǐ wǒ yóu de kuài, dànshì méiyǒu Dàwèi yóu de kuài.", "E": "他在哪儿呢？你看见他了吗？ Tā zài nǎr ne? Nǐ kànjiàn tā le ma?", "F": "住得远真的很累。 Zhù de yuǎn zhēn de hěn lèi."}, "answer": "A", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 35, "zh": "我和妻子一起去北京旅游了几天。", "pinyin": "Wǒ hé qīzi yìqǐ qù Běijīng lǚyóu le jǐ tiān.", "options": {"A": "路上车太多，坐公共汽车还没有走路快呢。 Lùshang chē tài duō, zuò gōnggòngqìchē hái méiyǒu zǒu lù kuài ne.", "B": "上个星期怎么没看到你？ Shàngge xīngqī zěnme méi kàndào nǐ?", "C": "天气太冷了，都零下十度了。 Tiānqì tài lěng le, dōu língxià shí dù le.", "D": "他比我游得快，但是没有大卫游得快。 Tā bǐ wǒ yóu de kuài, dànshì méiyǒu Dàwèi yóu de kuài.", "E": "他在哪儿呢？你看见他了吗？ Tā zài nǎr ne? Nǐ kànjiàn tā le ma?", "F": "住得远真的很累。 Zhù de yuǎn zhēn de hěn lèi."}, "answer": "B", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}, {"n": "三、语音 第一部分", "type_zh": "语音 第一部分 听录音", "instruction_zh": "第1题：听录音，注意句重音和句末的升降调", "instruction_en": "Question 1: Listen to the recording and pay attention to the stress in each sentence and the intonation at the end of each sentence.", "items": [{"n": "1-(1)", "zh": "你去商店想买牛奶还是买鸡蛋？↘［重读点：牛奶、鸡蛋］", "pinyin": "Nǐ qù shāngdiàn xiǎng mǎi niúnǎi háishi mǎi jīdàn?", "transcript_zh": "你去商店想买牛奶还是买鸡蛋？"}, {"n": "1-(2)", "zh": "你喜欢白色还是黑色？↘［重读点：白色、黑色］", "pinyin": "Nǐ xǐhuan báisè háishi hēisè?", "transcript_zh": "你喜欢白色还是黑色？"}, {"n": "1-(3)", "zh": "他们今天去运动还是明天去运动？↘［重读点：今天、明天］", "pinyin": "Tāmen jīntiān qù yùndòng háishi míngtiān qù yùndòng?", "transcript_zh": "他们今天去运动还是明天去运动？"}, {"n": "1-(4)", "zh": "现在是三点还是四点？↘［重读点：三点、四点］", "pinyin": "Xiànzài shì sān diǎn háishi sì diǎn?", "transcript_zh": "现在是三点还是四点？"}]}, {"n": "三、语音 第二部分", "type_zh": "语音 第二部分 跟读", "instruction_zh": "第2题：听录音并跟读下列句子，注意句重音和句末的升降调", "instruction_en": "Question 2: Listen to the recording and repeat the following sentences, paying attention to the stress in each sentence and the intonation at the end of each sentence.", "items": [{"n": "2-(1)", "zh": "这件衣服是今天买的还是昨天买的？↘［重读点：今天、昨天］", "pinyin": "Zhè jiàn yīfu shì jīntiān mǎi de háishi zuótiān mǎi de?", "transcript_zh": "这件衣服是今天买的还是昨天买的？"}, {"n": "2-(2)", "zh": "你想喝茶还是咖啡？↘［重读点：茶、咖啡］", "pinyin": "Nǐ xiǎng hē chá háishi kāfēi?", "transcript_zh": "你想喝茶还是咖啡？"}, {"n": "2-(3)", "zh": "前边说话的那个人是小王还是大卫？↘［重读点：小王、大卫］", "pinyin": "Qiánbian shuōhuà de nàge rén shì xiǎo Wáng háishi Dàwèi?", "transcript_zh": "前边说话的那个人是小王还是大卫？"}, {"n": "2-(4)", "zh": "今天是星期三还是星期四？↘［重读点：星期三、星期四］", "pinyin": "Jīntiān shì xīngqīsān háishi xīngqīsì?", "transcript_zh": "今天是星期三还是星期四？"}]}, {"n": "四、汉字 第一部分", "type_zh": "汉字 偏旁归类", "instruction_zh": "第1–2题：看汉字，按偏旁归类", "instruction_en": "Questions 1-2: Group the characters with the same radical.", "word_bank": [["A 步", "B 肉", "C 内", "D 肯"], ["E 同", "F 些", "G 此", "H 网"]], "items": [{"n": 1, "zh": "止：________", "answer": "A D F G", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": 2, "zh": "冂：________", "answer": "B C E H", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}, {"n": "四、汉字 第二部分", "type_zh": "汉字 猜词义", "instruction_zh": "第3题：看生词和图片，猜出词义", "instruction_en": "Question 3: Guess the meaning of each word based on the new words and pictures.", "word_bank": [["公园", "公司", "公用电话", "公共汽车"]], "items": [{"n": "3-公园", "zh": "公园 ________", "options": {"A": "[picture] a modern multi-storey office building with large windows", "B": "[picture] a double-decker bus on a street", "C": "[picture] a park with a lake, trees and a white pagoda on a hill", "D": "[picture] a public pay telephone mounted on a wall"}, "answer": "C", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": "3-公司", "zh": "公司 ________", "options": {"A": "[picture] a modern multi-storey office building with large windows", "B": "[picture] a double-decker bus on a street", "C": "[picture] a park with a lake, trees and a white pagoda on a hill", "D": "[picture] a public pay telephone mounted on a wall"}, "answer": "A", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": "3-公用电话", "zh": "公用电话 ________", "options": {"A": "[picture] a modern multi-storey office building with large windows", "B": "[picture] a double-decker bus on a street", "C": "[picture] a park with a lake, trees and a white pagoda on a hill", "D": "[picture] a public pay telephone mounted on a wall"}, "answer": "D", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}, {"n": "3-公共汽车", "zh": "公共汽车 ________", "options": {"A": "[picture] a modern multi-storey office building with large windows", "B": "[picture] a double-decker bus on a street", "C": "[picture] a park with a lake, trees and a white pagoda on a hill", "D": "[picture] a public pay telephone mounted on a wall"}, "answer": "B", "answer_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [138]}}]}], "answers_ref": {"book": "teacher", "pages": [137, 138]}}, "unclear": ["Сурах бичиг PDF х.109 热身1: зургийн үсэг «A B F / D E F» гэж хэвлэгдсэн — баруун дээд (3 дахь) зураг ч, баруун доод (6 дахь) зураг ч «F» тэмдэгтэй, «C» байхгүй. Багшийн ном PDF х.88 хариулт «①B ②D ③A ④E ⑤C ⑥F» — ⑤起床 = C нь баруун дээд (сунаж буй эмэгтэй) зураг гэж үзэгдэнэ; номд байгаагаар бичив.", "Нэр томьёоны зөрүү: сурах бичиг PDF х.112 注释1 «程度补语 (Complements of Degree)»; багшийн ном PDF х.87 教学目标， х.89 语言点， х.93 本课小结 «状态补语». Мөн 偏旁 «冂»: сурах бичиг PDF х.115 «同字头», багшийн ном PDF х.87, 92 «同字框» — номд байгаагаар.", "偏旁 «止» сурах бичиг PDF х.115, багшийн ном PDF х.87/92/93, дасгалын ном PDF х.122-т жижиг/тусгай хэлбэрээр хэвлэгдсэн; «冂» нь (OCR «门» гэж уншсан ч) зураг дээр «冂». JSON-д «止», «冂» гэж бичсэн.", "Багшийн ном PDF х.88 生词 扩展： «进» үгийн жишээнд «爸爸刚下飞机就去公司开会了。» — «进» агуулаагүй өгүүлбэр; номд байгаагаар.", "Багшийн ном PDF х.92 汉字 补充练习 a (找出), b (拆分), c (组合) — хариулт хэвлэгдээгүй. c-ийн сүүлчийн бүрэлдэхүүн «饣» гэж харагдсан (饣+反 → 饭 байж болох) — зураг жижиг, «饣» гэж бичив.", "Дасгалын ном PDF х.114 听力 第一部分 «第1–5题», багшийн номын хавсралт PDF х.137 «第1–6题» (бичвэр ба хариулт 5 л асуулт) — номд байгаагаар.", "Багшийн номын 课文 асуултууд (PDF х.90–91) «女的/男的» гэж дүрийг нэрлэсэн; сурах бичгийн 课文 мөрүүд зөвхөн A/B; сурах бичгийн 练习2 «她/他们» — номд байгаагаар.", "语音 (сурах бичиг PDF х.114–115, багшийн ном PDF х.92, дасгалын ном PDF х.121): онцлох (重读) хэсгийг ханзын доорх (улаан/хар) цэгээр, өгүүлбэрийн төгсгөлийг муруй доош сумаар тэмдэглэсэн; JSON-д «［重读点：…］», «↘» гэж бичсэн (номд текстээр байхгүй). Тайлбарт «前一部分读升调» гэсэн ч номд зөвхөн төгсгөлийн сум зурагдсан.", "Сурах бичиг PDF х.114 练习3 描述图片： 4 даалгавар дугааргүй (зураг/хүрээ зигзаг байрлалтай); n 1–4-ийг уншлагын дарааллаар (她唱得 → 爸爸开车 → 哥哥比我 → 爸爸比妈妈) өгсөн.", "Дасгалын ном PDF х.121 语音 2-(3) пиньинь «xiǎo Wáng» жижиг үсгээр, 2-(2) «你想喝茶还是咖啡» (咖啡-ийн өмнө 喝 байхгүй) — номд байгаагаар.", "Дасгалын ном PDF х.118 阅读 第三部分 例1-ийн пиньинь мөрөнд тоонууд (11, 30, 20, 10) орхигдсон — номд байгаагаар.", "Пиньинь: сурах бичиг 课文3 «líng xià shí dù» (салангид), дасгалын ном PDF х.117 (18), х.120 (C) «língxià» — номд байгаагаар. Дасгалын ном (16) 眼睛 «yǎnjing».", "Дасгалын номын 听力 13 бичвэр (багшийн ном PDF х.138) «我妻子做的比我好吃» (的) — номд байгаагаар.", "Сурах бичгийн 热身2, 练习2 回答问题， 练习3 描述图片 — хариулт хэвлэгдээгүй (热身2-т багшийн ном зөвхөн «说话 说汉语 说英语 ……» жишээ). 热身1-ийн хариулт зөвхөн багшийн номд (PDF х.88). Багшийн номын 语言点 操练-ийн хоосон зай (谁说得好？____) хариулт хэвлэгдээгүй.", "Багшийн номын «练习册相关练习：第106页…, 第109-110页…, 第113页， 第114页» ба «课本第94/95/96页» — хэвлэсэн хуудасны дугаар (дасгалын ном PDF х.114, 117–118, 121, 122; сурах бичиг PDF х.114–116).", "Дасгалын номын 听力 бичвэр (transcript_zh) ба бүх хариулт — багшийн номын хавсралт PDF х.137–138-аас; 例-ийн хариулт дасгалын номд өөрт нь хэвлэгдсэн. 三、语音 хэсэгт хариулт шаардлагагүй (сонсох/давтах).", "Дасгалын номын 三、语音 болон 四、汉字 хэсгийн дугаарлалт 1-ээс дахин эхэлдэг; 语音 1–2 асуулт тус бүр 4 өгүүлбэртэй тул n «1-(1)» гэх мэт.", "Аудио файлын нэр мэдэгдэхгүй тул audio талбар орхисон. Номын CD тэмдэг: сурах бичиг 课文1–4 = 12-1…12-4, 语音 12-5; дасгалын ном 听力 12-1, 语音 12-2.", "Энэ хичээлд 课堂用语 (classroom_expressions), 文化， 俗语 хэсэг ба 汉字 独体字/笔顺 хэсэг байхгүй (зөвхөн 偏旁). Багшийн номд 文化 алхам байхгүй.", "Зургийн тайлбарууд (picture_desc_en, pictures_desc_en, options «[picture]») зургаас товч, объектив дүрсэлсэн."], "verified_pages": [87, 88, 89, 90, 91, 92, 93, 109, 110, 111, 112, 113, 114, 115, 116, 117, 118, 119, 120, 121, 122, 137, 138], "schema_version": 1}'::jsonb, 1, 'image_verified')
